      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some more information + a work around. This error occurs in both the in-game auto conversion, and the Unity auto conversion. In unity, If you set your scale to EXACTLY 1 pre conversion, then change the scale back to what you had it before, after you convert. The discrepancy between the view point and where the rotation is happening doesn't occur. This is still a game breaking bug, as any avi already in the game that doesn't have perfect 1 scaling is going to have this occur.",
